{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00117",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.27,
      "end_seconds": 5.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Right, excuse me, doctor, should I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.36,
      "end_seconds": 9.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Yes, do sit. Tell me what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.57,
      "end_seconds": 21.08,
      "duration_seconds": 8.51,
      "text": "I, I wanted to get trouble hearing in my left ear looked at. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.06,
      "end_seconds": 26.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "And when did that start? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.4,
      "end_seconds": 30.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Yeah, for two years, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.15,
      "end_seconds": 31.85,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.82,
      "end_seconds": 43.86,
      "duration_seconds": 11.04,
      "text": "And I've been turning the TV up as well, for about a month. So, there was a feeling of fullness in the ear, yes, but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.19,
      "end_seconds": 50.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any ear pain, facial weakness, headache or discharge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.48,
      "end_seconds": 53.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "No, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.27,
      "end_seconds": 56.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "And dizziness, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.5,
      "end_seconds": 60.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "No, um, I haven't had any dizziness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.45,
      "end_seconds": 64.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.28,
      "end_seconds": 67.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "No, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.8,
      "end_seconds": 74.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.77,
      "end_seconds": 76.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.16,
      "end_seconds": 80.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.05,
      "end_seconds": 87.24,
      "duration_seconds": 6.19,
      "text": "Metformin, 500 milligrams, twice a day. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.63,
      "end_seconds": 90.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.25,
      "end_seconds": 93.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.94,
      "end_seconds": 109.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.45,
      "end_seconds": 114.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Diabetes, for about a year. High blood pressure, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.0,
      "end_seconds": 122.1,
      "duration_seconds": 7.1,
      "text": "Go on. Okay, high blood pressure, that's already on your record. Good to know. So, any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.66,
      "end_seconds": 127.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Just a lump removed from my back, years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.77,
      "end_seconds": 131.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.91,
      "end_seconds": 143.8,
      "duration_seconds": 10.89,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.38,
      "end_seconds": 146.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Okay, I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.34,
      "end_seconds": 155.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.92,
      "end_seconds": 189.55,
      "duration_seconds": 22.63,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 97 percent on room air, pulse is 84 beats a minute, blood pressure 120 over 74, temp 36.5 degrees. I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.88,
      "end_seconds": 192.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.39,
      "end_seconds": 198.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.23,
      "end_seconds": 199.93,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.26,
      "end_seconds": 203.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "I'll just listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.08,
      "end_seconds": 222.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "There's a lot of wax in the left ear canal, I can't see the drum."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.01,
      "end_seconds": 225.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.44,
      "end_seconds": 240.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "The right ear canal and drum are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.99,
      "end_seconds": 256.26,
      "duration_seconds": 11.27,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.78,
      "end_seconds": 268.78,
      "duration_seconds": 12.0,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.17,
      "end_seconds": 281.43,
      "duration_seconds": 12.26,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: My working impression is hearing loss from wax. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I can't rule out age-related hearing loss yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.56,
      "end_seconds": 285.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.73,
      "end_seconds": 303.26,
      "duration_seconds": 17.53,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now hearing loss from wax is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had trouble hearing in your left ear for two years, and no headache or ear pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.19,
      "end_seconds": 305.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.21,
      "end_seconds": 309.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.08,
      "end_seconds": 311.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.88,
      "end_seconds": 320.64,
      "duration_seconds": 7.76,
      "text": "I'm going to order a hearing test, for hearing loss. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 321.37,
      "end_seconds": 323.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "The earliest is Thursday, 9 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.84,
      "end_seconds": 350.05,
      "duration_seconds": 25.21,
      "text": "Let's use ear drops, three times a day, for five days. It's for wax softening. Please don't use cotton buds or ear candles, they push the wax in further. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.45,
      "end_seconds": 360.21,
      "duration_seconds": 8.76,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently. Come back after the hearing test."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 360.89,
      "end_seconds": 361.59,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.31,
      "end_seconds": 369.76,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.76,
      "end_seconds": 374.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "So, I come back after the hearing test. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 375.34,
      "end_seconds": 379.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, I think we're finished. Is everything clear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 380.62,
      "end_seconds": 383.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Nothing more from me, doctor, thanks."
    }
  ]
}